    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2d Metroidvania exploration with 5-9 hours of playtime.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soulslike combat against\u00a0Elovelle's toughest thugs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six free-flowing movement weapons can be found throughout the city.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Rush Mode unlocks once you beat the game for the first time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449730/extras/c59c469444c50ed96824216cd61704e7.avif?t=1751394522\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elovelle. A city of devils.\u00a0Demons across the city fractured into clans in the pursuit of their desires. The most notorious among them were the Knights of Virtue.\u00a0The Knights of Virtue seized the famed\u00a0Fountain of Elovelle and built a fortress around it. Speaking words of virtue to the powerful Essence.\u00a0Many clans now wage war against the Knights. Attempting to take the fountain's power for themselves and become the new masters\u00a0of the city.\u00a0Chaos reigns across\u00a0Elovelle. Ferality spreads\u00a0throughout the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of one who would try to heal\u00a0the broken heart of this city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And how I stopped her\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2d Metroidvania exploration with 5-9 hours of playtime.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soulslike combat against\u00a0Elovelle's toughest thugs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six free-flowing movement weapons can be found throughout the city.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Rush Mode unlocks once you beat the game for the first time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449730/extras/c59c469444c50ed96824216cd61704e7.avif?t=1751394522\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elovelle. A city of devils.\u00a0Demons across the city fractured into clans in the pursuit of their desires. The most notorious among them were the Knights of Virtue.\u00a0The Knights of Virtue seized the famed\u00a0Fountain of Elovelle and built a fortress around it. Speaking words of virtue to the powerful Essence.\u00a0Many clans now wage war against the Knights. Attempting to take the fountain's power for themselves and become the new masters\u00a0of the city.\u00a0Chaos reigns across\u00a0Elovelle. Ferality spreads\u00a0throughout the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of one who would try to heal\u00a0the broken heart of this city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And how I stopped her\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
